      "name": "Traits",
      "rulesText": "Confer Fire Resistance. The nightmare can grant Resistance to Fire damage to a rider while it is on the nightmare.\n\nIllumination. The nightmare sheds Bright Light in a 10-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 10 feet.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.175",
        "heading": "Traits",
        "lineStart": 23523,
        "lineEnd": 23527
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Actions",
      "rulesText": "Hooves. Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 13 (2d8 + 4) Bludgeoning damage plus 10 (3d6) Fire damage.\n\nEthereal Stride. The nightmare and up to three willing creatures within 5 feet of it teleport to the Ethereal Plane from the Material Plane or vice versa.",
      "sourceLocator": {
